@startuml
title Statechart diagram of the class "Website"

state "Homepage" as Homepage
state "Project Details" as ProjectDetails
state "Photos" as Photos
state "Videos" as Videos
state "Career Opportunities" as CareerOpportunities
state "Updates" as Updates
state "Application Form" as ApplicationForm

[*] --> Homepage : navigate to homepage
Homepage : entry / user navigates to homepage
Homepage --> ProjectDetails : select project from navigation bar
ProjectDetails : entry / selected project details
ProjectDetails --> Photos : view photos of the project
Photos : entry / view photos
Photos --> Videos : view videos of the project
Videos : entry / view videos

ProjectDetails --> CareerOpportunities : select career opportunities from navigation bar
CareerOpportunities : entry / selected career opportunities
CareerOpportunities --> Updates : view updates about career opportunities
Updates : entry / view updates
Updates --> ApplicationForm : open application form for employment or internship
ApplicationForm : entry / open application form

ApplicationForm --> [*] : submit job application
[*] --> CheckApplications : submitted job applications checked

CheckApplications : entry / check submitted job applications
CheckApplications --> [*] : no issues with job application
[*] --> Homepage : navigate back to homepage

@enduml
